sequenceDiagram
  participant T as tap target
  participant C as document, capture
  participant H as target handler
  participant B as document, bubble
  T->>C: click descends
  C->>C: fromInside = panel or bubble contains target
  C->>H: continue to target
  H->>H: retireAnswers removes the button
  H->>B: click bubbles up
  B->>B: closePanel only if not fromInside
